#. ja: 衛兵団の強化薬
#. de: Fläschchen[p] Crystarium-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant cristarien
#. column 2: flasks of crystalline ester
#. column 8: A sparkling substance produced by the artisans of the Crystalline Mean, used─when resources permit─to enhance the properties of Crystarium weapons such as those used by the guard. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Crystalline Ester
msgctxt "Item:29032:0:0"
msgid "flask of crystalline ester"
msgstr ""

#. de: Fläschchen[p] Crystarium-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fioles d'agent renforçant cristarien
#. column 0: flask of crystalline ester
#. column 8: A sparkling substance produced by the artisans of the Crystalline Mean, used─when resources permit─to enhance the properties of Crystarium weapons such as those used by the guard. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Crystalline Ester
msgctxt "Item:29032:0:2"
msgid "flasks of crystalline ester"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ミーン工芸館が作り出した錬金薬。<br>クリスタリウム武器の強化に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【武器】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Ein in der Manufaktur der Gemeinschaft hergestelltes Lösungsmittel, das die Eigenschaften von Crystarium-Waffen verstärkt.  Früher ein begehrtes Gut, doch die Technologie hat sich inzwischen weiterentwickelt und das Lösungsmittel ist quasi nutzlos geworden.
#. fr: Une mixture alchimique provenant de la halle du Juste. Elle permettait autrefois d'améliorer l'efficacité des armes cristariennes. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise pour ça aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: flask of crystalline ester
#. column 2: flasks of crystalline ester
#. column 9: Crystalline Ester
msgctxt "Item:29032:0:8"
msgid "A sparkling substance produced by the artisans of the Crystalline Mean, used─when resources permit─to enhance the properties of Crystarium weapons such as those used by the guard. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr ""

