#. ja: 第二次復興用のピラルク
#. de: Genist-Pirarucu
#. fr: pirarucu de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 2: grade 2 skybuilders' pirarucu
#. column 8: The pirarucu's habit of swallowing the lure whole means that most anglers wait until the beast is well and truly dead before they attempt to retrieve it. There is always the option of leaving it in the fish's belly─but that would be a nasty surprise for the poor soul who has to gut it.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
#. column 9: Grade 2 Skybuilders' Pirarucu
msgctxt "Item:29998:0:0"
msgid "grade 2 skybuilders' pirarucu"
msgstr ""

